Certainly! I'll help you write a Terraform module that meets your requirements:

- Create or reuse an ECS cluster
- Create an ECS service with the Cloudflare Warp image from ECR
- Create a CodePipeline to deploy the ECR image
- Inject a token (from Parameter Store) as environment variable in the ECS task definition

