  The first five letters get cost 1 each, so total cost is 1*1 + 1*1 + … = 5.

• The algorithm always assigns the most frequent letters to the positions with the lowest cost (lowest push count). Thus, we guarantee that the total number of pushes is minimized.

This code handles the input word and computes the answer in O(n + 26 log 26) time which is efficient for the problem constraints.

